<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="GAL" style="id">- Teke-Tyee</book>
  <para style="h">NGALATE</para>
  <para style="toc3">Nga</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ngalate</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mukaana a Poole kundaa basi Ngalate</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mukaana a Poole kundaa basi</para>
  <para style="mt1">NGALATE</para>
  <para style="imt">OSOMO</para>
  <para style="ip">Wu me mukaana wu osóno Poole kundaa mabwunu ma Nzaami ma máli ku etsulu e nsie kii Ngalate. Nde áli agyene oko mansa mwolo, mu oyitsala bo Nsia yi Mbwe. Ba-Dzwife ya baala ka bali ba-Dzwife o, bákagyagha Nsia oyo mu okala bakeretyẽ. Poole ákaluo bo ti yini a kana mu Yiisu likughu osa ti, Nzaami amono bo baara baba nsumu. Lo ŋa mbihi a mana a matala, ba-Dzwife bana, bágyene ku Ngalate oko. Ya bákalyele oko ti, bakwuru mu banga-a-kana baba ku Yerusaleme báagweghe bo. Bo bádzihibi myehene mi ókaluo Poole. Bo bákabululyele ti nde ka áli ntumu wu a ngaŋma o, ya nde ka ákaluo engaŋma o. Bo bákalyele kundaa bo ti, buulu baala ka bali ba-Dzwife o baasi kana mu Yiisu, bo bafaana si osalala mi ookatumu Mikyene mi Moyidze. Bo bákagyili onyeme ndagha yi a osomo nzo a mbaa. Bo ti, ngu osomo nzo a mbaa ookasa kuulu ti Nzaami amono bo ti bo bali baara baba nsumu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Basi Ngalate si bábaana okasa obo. Ya Poole bu ágyughu ndagha oyo, nde ákolo nkehe yi alagha. Mu kuulu, ka oli onama Mikyene mi Moyidze okughu osa ti Nzaami amono bo baara baba nsumu. Me mu obo Poole ásono mukaana kundaa babo ba báli ku Ngalate, mu osuo bo ti Nzaami ka ályele obo o. Osomo nzo a mbaa ku bályele, me osa ti mufulu a mbwuru faana okala wu a tse-tse. Nde ályele bo ti Nzaami ámono Abarahame, Taara a ba-Dzwife, mbwuru wu a nsumu ŋaala nde áli nkini ásomo nzo a mbaa o. Lo yini a kana mu Yiisu, wu áakpi ŋa kuruwa, likughu osa ti bihi-a-be bikala baba nsumu ya likala a bigyighili bi biikagwa Nzaami esee.</para>
  <para style="ib" />
  <para style="iot">Mu obo, mukaana wu bakabala nde mu manzili nsaama ma:</para>
  <para style="io1">- Mamboro ya Nsia nga-mõ yi Mbwe: (<char style="xt"><ref loc="GAL 1:1-10">1.1-10</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">- Poole gyagha Nsia yi Mbwe: (<char style="xt"><ref loc="GAL 1:1-2:14">1.1–2.14</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">- Mu kana baara baabvwughu: (<char style="xt"><ref loc="GAL 2:15-5:1">2.15–5.1</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">- Kriste ágwi bihi bumpoholo: (<char style="xt"><ref loc="GAL 5:2-12">5.2-12</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">- Okala mu litumu li Mufulu, lo ka mu lili nyuru o: (<char style="xt"><ref loc="GAL 5:13-26">5.13-26</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">- Osala mu nkooro a bubwe bu banganda: (<char style="xt"><ref loc="GAL 6:1-10">6.1-10</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">- Ogyehe kuu masini ya mamboro: (<char style="xt"><ref loc="GAL 6:11-18">6.11-18</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="GAL 1" />
  <para style="s1">Mamboro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 1:1" />Me Poole, wu li ntumu, mu gwaa li Yiisu-Kriste ya lili Nzaami, Taara wu áasiili nde ŋa kara li ba bápki, lo me ka ndi ntumu mu dzyi li baara o, bwunu we mu libaha li mbwuru. <verse eid="GAL 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 1:2" />Emõ ya bandughu mu kana bwohono ba bali kunu ya me, me nsono mukaana wu kundaa mabwunu ma Nzaami ma mali mu etsulu e nsie kii Ngalati mu olyele ti: <verse eid="GAL 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 1:3" />Nyaã bwehe ya edzuunu bi bifi kundaa Nzaami Taara a bihi ya kundaa Mfumu a bihi Yiisu-Kriste, bikala ya be! <verse eid="GAL 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 1:4" />Yiisu-Kriste ágwi bumweẽ bu nde ndeme mu nkooro a masumu ma bihi-a-be, mpaala akwulu bihi-a-be mu nsie yi a bubi yi, ti bwunu a bu oli gwaa li Nzaami, wu li Taara a bihi-a-be. <verse eid="GAL 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 1:5" />Nyaã nsia a Nzaami yikala yi mibvu ya mibvu! Amene.<verse eid="GAL 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nsia nga-mõ yi Mbwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 1:6" />Me nkiŋimi mu maswa ma liisi be mu otyeghe munde wu aati be mbili mu bwehe bu Kriste mbihi, mu onama nsia yi mbwe nkimi. <verse eid="GAL 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 1:7" />Lo mu ogyighili otala, ka yili Nsia yi Mbwe nkimi o, mu kuulu yini a baara ba bali mu okasa yaghala ŋa kara li be, ya ba badzyi obyihi Nsia yi Mbwe yi a Kriste. <verse eid="GAL 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 1:8" />Lo kala ti mbwuru, bwunu we bihi bameme, bwunu we kala ti ngye-yulu mumõ wu a mayulu tsala be Nsia yi Mbwe, yili a lisobo ya yi liitsala bihi be, nyaã babiili nde epwolo! <verse eid="GAL 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 1:9" />Bihi liimaatswama olyele be yo, ya mu matala ma me firindyele ti: Kala ti mbwuru tsala be Nsia yi Mbwe nkimi yili a lisobo ya yi liigyagha be, nyaã babiili nde epwolo!<verse eid="GAL 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 1:10" />Mu matala ma, me bu ndi mu okasagha ti baara bakihi me, bwunu we kuulu ti Nzaami akihi me? Baara me ndi mu osagha ogwa esee? Pele, kala ti me baara aakandzyi ogwa esee, nkini me ka akaankihi okala musala a Kriste o.<verse eid="GAL 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Poole gyagha ya tuoho Nsia yi Mbwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 1:11" />Bandughu ba me mu kana, mu engaŋma, me ndyele kundaa be ti: Nsia yi Mbwe yi, yi aantuoho me be ka yifi kundaa a mbwuru o. <verse eid="GAL 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 1:12" />Mu kuulu, ka oli mbwuru aagyaha me yo o, bwunu we aaluo me yo, lo Yiisu-Kriste áasuo me yo.<verse eid="GAL 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 1:13" />Buulu be líigyughu bu óli nzya-nzyara a me mu matala ma makulu, ŋa ándi me mu libwunu li ba-Dzwife. Be lisoolo bu áakamwehẽ me libwunu li kimini mu dzighi, ya bu áakansagha me odzwa lo. <verse eid="GAL 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 1:14" />Mu osalala ku mikyene ya ekulu ki ba-Dzwife, me áakamvulu ba-Dzwife balagha ba bali eseene emõ ya me. Mu kuulu me áandi a ebaa kii elagha mu okakala ekulu ki bankagha ba bihi.<verse eid="GAL 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 1:15" />Lo Nzaami wu áasuolo me obaana mu mweẽ a ngughu a me, ya wu áati me mbili mu bubwe bu nde, <verse eid="GAL 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 1:16" />nde aamono bubwe mu osuo me Mwana a nde mu matala ma, mu kuulu me ntuoho Nsia yi Mbwe yi a nkwumu a nde kundaa baala ka bali ba-Dzwife o. Lo mbala mõ, me ka ánduomo luo kundaa mbwuru o, <verse eid="GAL 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 1:17" />ya me ka ámangye ku Yerusaleme mu oyimono babo ba báli bantumu nsomo ya me o. Lo me áangyene ku nsie yi a Arabi. Bu ámara oko, me áambvughuru ku bvulu lili Damase.<verse eid="GAL 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 1:18" />Yini a ŋa mbihi a bamvulu batere, me áankumu ku Yerusaleme mu oyimoŋo ya Sefase<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sefase ngu Piere</char></note>. Ya me áansi bitsughu kwumu ya bitaana (15) ya nde. <verse eid="GAL 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 1:19" />Me ka ámono ntumu mukimi o, kala ti ka yini a Dzake o, mbwee a Mfumu. <verse eid="GAL 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 1:20" />Nzaami li mpughulu mu mandagha ma ma ndi mu osono me be, me ka mpfiri mpya o.<verse eid="GAL 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 1:21" />Ŋa mbihi oŋo, me áangyene ku bitsulu bi nsie bibi Siri ya bibi Silisi. <verse eid="GAL 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 1:22" />Lo baara baba mabwunu ma Nzaami mama mu etsulu e nsie kii Yude, ma máli mu Kriste, nkini ka bámaamono edzili e me o. <verse eid="GAL 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 1:23" />Bo yini a nsia ali bágyughu ti: «Munde wu áakamwehẽ bihi-a-be kimini mu matala ma máluru, mu matala ma, li mu okabulutsala ti anga nsia yi mbwe yi a kana li ákasagha nde odzihibi». <verse eid="GAL 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 1:24" />Mu obo bo bákasyighi Nzaami mu nkooro a me.<verse eid="GAL 1:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="GAL 2" />
  <para style="s1">Ogwihini ku bantumu ku Yerusaleme</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 2:1" />Ŋa mbihi a bamvulu kwumu ya bana (14), me áafirimvughuru ku Yerusaleme emõ ya Baranabase. Ya me áambiri si Tite. <verse eid="GAL 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 2:2" />Me áankumu oko mu litumu li ógwi me Nzaami. Me áangyene oko ya áanduo bo Nsia yi Mbwe yi ákantsala me kundaa baala ka bali ba-Dzwife o. Me áanduo si yo mu bimoŋo kundaa baara ba babvulu mupfunu. Me áanduo bo, mu kuulu esala ki ánsi me nsomo ya ki ndi mu okasa me mu matala ma, enyaã okala kii bwunu. <verse eid="GAL 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 2:3" />Lo Tite, wu áali ya me, ka bátsiini nde mu mpini o mu osomo nzo a mbaa, si bu áli nde mu-Ngereke. <verse eid="GAL 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 2:4" />Óli a bandughu mu kana baba mpya, ba básomo mu mayele ŋa kara li emvuŋunu e bihi. Bo bágyi mu okeene bumpoholo bu lili a bihi mu Yiisu-Kriste, mpaala basa bihi bankana ba Mikyene. <verse eid="GAL 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 2:5" />Lo si ekee, bihi ka líkihi onama mandagha ma baara babo o, mu kuulu bihi líidzyi ti engaŋma ki Nsia yi Mbwe ekakala mu be.<verse eid="GAL 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 2:6" />Baara baba mupfunu báli si oko. Lo ngu okala ti bo báli bamfumu, kundaa me, bumfumu bu bo ka buli ndagha yi mupfunu o, mu kuulu Nzaami ka aakatala bidzili o. Ya bamfumu baba mupfunu babo, ka bátumu me mbwehe ndagha si mõ mu maluo ma me o. <verse eid="GAL 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 2:7" />Lo bo bu bamono ti Nzaami ágwi me litumu mu oyitsala Nsia yi Mbwe kundaa ba bággwene osomo nzo a mbaa, ti bwunu a bu ágwi nde Piere litumu mu oyitsala Nsia yi Mbwe kundaa ba básomo nzo a mbaa, <verse eid="GAL 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 2:8" />mu kuulu munde wu áasi ti Piere akala ntumu kundaa ba básomo nzo a mbaa, me ndehe si áasi ti me nkala ntumu kundaa baala ka bali ba-Dzwife o, <verse eid="GAL 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 2:9" />Dzake, Sefase ya Dzã ba báli makwii ma libwunu li Nzaami, bu babaghala ti Nzaami áagwi me bwehe bubo, bo bágwi bihi ya Baranabase mboro yi a ekee, mu osuo ti líili bumõ ya bo mu esala. Ya bo, líigwihini ti, bihi ligye kundaa baara ba bágwene osomo nzo a mbaa, ya bo bagye kundaa baara ba básomo nzo a mbaa. <verse eid="GAL 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 2:10" />Bo bátswi bihi mukele ti likatsimini bawele, ya me áakansa ndagha oyo mu mukolo mumõ.<verse eid="GAL 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Poole syeme Piere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 2:11" />Lo ŋa ógyi Sefase<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sefase me Piere</char></note> ku bvulu lili Antyose, me áambihi nzya-nzyara a nde ŋa nkulu a baara bwohono, mu kuulu nde ka áli ya bwuu mu osa obo o. <verse eid="GAL 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 2:12" />Nsomo ndaama a baara ba ógweghe Dzake bayato, Sefase ákadza emõ ya baala ka báli ba-Dzwife o. Lo baara babo bu bayato, nde ágweŋe ya ákaghaba ya baala ka báli ba-Dzwife o. Nde ási obo mu nkooro a nzalamweẽ a ba básomo nzo a mbaa. <verse eid="GAL 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 2:13" />Ba-Dzwife babake bákanama bu ákasa nde. Baranabase si ágyene mu nkwu-nkwughu a nzya-nzyara a bo yi bumpibi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.13 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">bumpibi </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ngu oggwene a engaŋma.</char></note>. <verse eid="GAL 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 2:14" />Lo me bu mono ti bo ka bákadzyara kunsa engaŋma ki Nsia yi Mbwe o, me áandyele kundaa Sefase ŋa nkulu a baara bwohono ti: «We wuli mu-Dzwife li mu okadzyara ti anga baara baala ka bali ba-Dzwife o. Lo we ka li mu okadzyara ti anga bu ookadzyara ba-Dzwife o! Bunu we kughu otsiini baala ka bali ba-Dzwife o banama bipfu bi ba-Dzwife?»<verse eid="GAL 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mu kana baara baakabvwughu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 2:15" />Bihi-a-be lili ba-Dzwife baba emburu-ngughu, bihi-a-be ka lili mu kaba lili banga-a-masumu ba o, baala ka bali ba-Dzwife o. <verse eid="GAL 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 2:16" />Lo bihi-a-be lisoolo ti Mikyene ka mikughu osa o ti mbwuru akala nga-a-bunsumu ŋa mihi mi Nzaami, lo yini a mu osa kana mu Yiisu-Kriste. Bihi si liisi kana mu Yiisu-Kriste mpaala basa ti bihi likala banga-a-bunsumu mu kana li bihi mu Nde, lo ka mu onama Mikyene o. Mu kuulu, Mikyene ka mikughu osa o ti mbwuru akala nga-a-bunsumu ŋa mihi mi Nzaami. <verse eid="GAL 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 2:17" />Bihi-a-be lili mu okasagha ti Nzaami asa bihi-a-be likala banga-a-bunsumu mu Kriste. Bu liisi bubo, baamono ti bihi-a-be lili banga-a-masumu. Kala ti me obo, ngu Kriste aasi kuulu ti bihi-a-be likala banga-a-masumu? Pele, ka bubo o! <verse eid="GAL 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 2:18" />Mu obo, kala ti me firintwu bibye bi aantsala me, me ndi mu osuo ti me ndi mu otsala Mikyene. <verse eid="GAL 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 2:19" />Mu kuulu, me ndi wu aakpi mu Mikyene, mu okala mweẽ mu Nzaami. Bákomo me ŋa kuruwa emõ ya Kriste. <verse eid="GAL 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 2:20" />Me bu ndi mweẽ, ka oli me o, lo Kriste li mweẽ mu me. Mu bumweẽ bu me bubu mu musunu, me ndi a bo mu kana mu Mwana a Nzaami wu áadzyi me ya wu áagwi nyuru a nde ndeme mu nkooro a me. <verse eid="GAL 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 2:21" />Me ka mbihi bwehe bu Nzaami o, mu kuulu, kala ti bunsumu buli mu onama Mikyene, lo Kriste kuu bwunu ákpi.<verse eid="GAL 2:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="GAL 3" />
  <para style="s1">Mikyene bwunu we osa kana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 3:1" />Aa baara ba Ngalate, be mayele we! Nande aabiili be mpwoho? Be baala, ŋa mihi mi be bágyighili osuo Yiisu-Kriste wu bákomo ŋa kuruwa. <verse eid="GAL 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 3:2" />Limatsimi ati mu ndagha yi: Mufulu wu lígyagha be, be líigyagha nde mu nkooro a osalala Mikyene, bwunu we mu nkooro a ku lígyughu be Nsia yi Mbwe, mpaala be lisa kana mu yo? <verse eid="GAL 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 3:3" />Bunu-abo be likughu okala a buwulu mu eteese kii bu? Be líibaana mu Mufulu, ya mu matala ma be lidzyi omana mu embwuru? <verse eid="GAL 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 3:4" />Mandagha mwohono ma liibwana a be ma, mama bwunu? Ka okughu okala ti kuu bwunu o! <verse eid="GAL 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 3:5" />Nzaami aakagwa be Mufulu a nde ya aakasa bimaã ŋa kara li be. Mu nkooro a Mikyene mi liikanama be, bwunu we mu nkooro a Nsia yi Mbwe yi a kana yi lígyughu be nde aakasa obo?<verse eid="GAL 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Banga-a-kana bali ba báseme ya Abarahame</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 3:6" />Buulu, Abarahame <char style="qt">ási kana mu Nzaami, Nzaami ámono nde ti mbwuru nga-a-bunsumu.</char> <verse eid="GAL 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 3:7" />Lo be lifaana osoolo yo ti, babo ba baakasa kana, me bo bali baana ba Abarahame. <verse eid="GAL 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 3:8" />Bisono bítswama olyele yo ti, Nzaami sa asa kuulu ti baara baala ka bali ba-Dzwife o, bakala baara ba nga-a-bunsumu mu kana. Nde átuoho nsia yi mbwe yi kundaa Abarahame: «Bikaana byehene sa bibagha liseme mu we<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.8 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 12:3">Eba 12.3</ref></char></note>.» <verse eid="GAL 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 3:9" />Mu obo, babo ba baakasa kana, bali ba báseme mu Abarahame, munga-a-kana.<verse eid="GAL 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 3:10" />Babo bwohono ba baakasa mukolo mu onama Mikyene bali kunsa epwolo. Mu kuulu básono ti: <char style="qt">Epwolo kundaa mbwuru wu aagwene osa mukama mu onama mandagha mwohono ma básono munsa mukaana a mikyene!</char> <verse eid="GAL 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 3:11" />Mu engaŋma, ŋa busu bu Nzaami ka oli a mbwuru si mumõ wuli nsumu bu aakanama mikyene o, mu kuulu básono si ti: <char style="qt">«Mbwuru nga-a-bunsumu sa akala mweẽ mu kana.</char>» <verse eid="GAL 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 3:12" />Lo Mikyene ka mítala kana o, lo mu mye básono ti: <char style="qt">«Munde wu aakanama mandagha mwohono ma ookatumu mikyene sa akala mweẽ mu mye.</char>» <verse eid="GAL 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 3:13" />Kriste ákwulu bihi-a-be mu epwolo ki Mikyene, bu ákighiri nde ndeme epwolo mu nkooro a bihi-a-be, ti bwunu a bu básono ti: <char style="qt">«Epwolo kundaa munde wu baamaŋana ŋa yulu a muti.</char>» <verse eid="GAL 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 3:14" />Mu kuulu, mu Yiisu-Kriste liseme li líyato tee kundaa baala ka bali ba-Dzwife o, mpaala mu kana, bihi-a-be ligyagha Mufulu wu ógwi Nzaami misiini.<verse eid="GAL 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mikyene ya misiini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 3:15" />Bandughu mu kana, mu mi mitala bipfu bi baara: Kala ti mbwuru sono mukaana wu osuo gwaa li bafaana onama ŋa mbihi a lipfu li nde, mbwuru mukimi ka kughu omaha o, bwunu we obwehe ndagha nkimi o mu mi aasono nde. <verse eid="GAL 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 3:16" />Mu obo, misiini bágwi mye kundaa Abarahame ya kundaa munde wu aapala mu etagha e nde. Ka bályele o ti: «Ya kundaa ba baapala mu etagha e nde», mu olyele ti kundaa baara balagha, lo yini a kundaa mbwuru mutsyini: <char style="qt">Wu aapala mu etagha e we</char>, mbaala ti «Kriste». <verse eid="GAL 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 3:17" />Me bu ndzyi olyele ti: Nzaami átswama osono mukaana mu osuo mandagha ma maagya ku nkulu. Mikyene mi mígyi ŋa mbihi a bamvulu nkama-na ya makwumu-matere (430) ka mikughu okahaba misiini mimye o, ya osa kuulu ti misiini mimye mikala mimi bwunu. <verse eid="GAL 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 3:18" />Kala ti pfa okabagha mu mikyene, ka bakughu ofiribagha nde mu misiini o. Bu ta ngu mu misiini Nzaami ágwi liseme kundaa Abarahame.<verse eid="GAL 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Esala ki Mukyene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 3:19" />Mu obo, mupfunu a mikyene muma? Mikyene bábwehe mye mu okasuo masumu ma ookasa baara, tee mu matala ma oogya munde wu bágwi misiini. Ngu bangye-yulu báayasuo Mikyene, mu wu aakabvuhulu ogwihini. <verse eid="GAL 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 3:20" />Lo mubvughu ogwihini wu a mbwuru ngasighi ka li o. Ya Nzaami li yini a mumõ. <verse eid="GAL 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 3:21" />Obo, mu olyele ti mikyene mili mutaara a misiini mi Nzaami? Pele, ka bukughu okala obo o! Kala ti oli a mukyene wu aakagwa bumweẽ, nkini li bunsumu bukaagya mu mikyene. <verse eid="GAL 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 3:22" />Lo Bisono biikalyele ti baara bwohono bali kunsa bunkana bu masumu, mpaala ba baakasa kana mu Yiisu-Kriste bagyagha byehene bi ósiini a bo Nzaami.<verse eid="GAL 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 3:23" />Ŋaala áli kana nkini ogya we, bihi-a-be líili kunsa bunkana bu mikyene, mpaala likebe matala ma oomoŋono kana lilo. <verse eid="GAL 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 3:24" />Mu obo, mikyene míli nkyele a bihi-a-be mu matala ma likakebe Kriste, mu kuulu likala baara baba nsumu mu kana. <verse eid="GAL 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 3:25" />Lo kana bu liigyi, bihi-a-be ka liifirisyili kunsa litumu li nkyele munde o. <verse eid="GAL 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 3:26" />Mu kuulu, be bwohono lili baana ba Nzaami, mu kana li liikasa mu Yiisu-Kriste. <verse eid="GAL 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 3:27" />Mu obo, be bwohono ba báboghoro mu Yiisu-Kriste, be líilaha Kriste mu nyuru. <verse eid="GAL 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 3:28" />Ka ofirisyili a mu-Dzwife o, bwunu we mu-Ngereke. Ka ofirisyili a nkana o, bwunu we mbwuru wu bumpoholo. Ka ofirisyili a baghala o, bwunu we mukaha, mu kuulu be bwohono lili mbwuru mumõ mu Yiisu-Kriste. <verse eid="GAL 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 3:29" />Ya kala ti be lili baba ndaa Kriste, lo be lili baba mu etagha kii ndaa Abarahame, be liibyala pfa li nde, ti bwunu a bu oli misiini mi ógwi Nzaami.<verse eid="GAL 3:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="GAL 4" />
  <para style="s1">We ka aafirisyili nkana o, lo we li mwana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 4:1" />Me bu ndzyi olyele: Mu matala maala mwana munde wu akala aabyala mukobo li nkini ngaye, ŋa kara li nde ya nkana ka oli a lisobo o, nde wuulu li mfumu a bilogho byehene. <verse eid="GAL 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 4:2" />Lo nde aakakala mu litumu li ba bali mu okakwuhu nde ya ba bali mu okakebe bilogho bi nde tee mu matala ma ókuru taara a nde. <verse eid="GAL 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 4:3" />Oli si bumõ kundaa bihi-a-be. Ŋa líli bihi-a-be baana ba basala, bihi-a-be líili bankana ba mandagha ma nsie. <verse eid="GAL 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 4:4" />Lo matala bu makughu, Nzaami aagweghe Mwana a nde, wu óburu mukaha, ŋa lili nkini kunsa litumu li mikyene, <verse eid="GAL 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 4:5" />mu okwulu ba bali kunsa litumu li mikyene, mpaala bihi-a-be likala baana ba ákwuhu nde. <verse eid="GAL 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 4:6" />Mu kuulu be lili baana, Nzaami ágweghe Mufulu a Mwana a nde, munsa mikolo mi bihi-a-be. Nde wu li mu okakehe engubu ti: <char style="qt">Aba</char>, Taara! <verse eid="GAL 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 4:7" />Mu obo we ka aafirisyili nkana o, lo we li mwana. Ya buulu we li mwana, Nzaami sa agwa we mukobo wu ásiini a nde baana ba nde.<verse eid="GAL 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nzalamweẽ a Poole mu nkooro a kana li baara ba Ngalate</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 4:8" />Mu nsi-nkulu, be ka áli lisoolo Nzaami o, ya be líili bankana ba banzaami baba mpya. <verse eid="GAL 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 4:9" />Lo mu matala ma, be lisoolo Nzaami, bwunu we Nzaami soolo be. Bunu-abo be likughu ofiribvughuru mu bilogho bi bigwene a lileene ya mupfunu? Be lidzyi ofirikala bankana ba bye? <verse eid="GAL 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 4:10" />Be liikagwa bitsughu, bangoono, mando ya bamvulu budziri bu bulagha! <verse eid="GAL 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 4:11" />Me ndi a nzalamweẽ ti mara esala kii mpini ki aansi me mu be ekala kii bwunu.<verse eid="GAL 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 4:12" />Bandughu mu kana, me mbuono be. Likadzyara ti anga me, mu kuulu mehe si ayi ndi ti anga be<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.12 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">mehe si ayi ndi ti anga be </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ndehe si ka afirikadzyara ti anga ba-Dzwife o.</char></note>. Be ka liisi me ndagha si mõ yi mbi o. <verse eid="GAL 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 4:13" />Be ligyighili osoolo yo bubwe, ti ebyele mu nyuru éegwi me nzili mu otsala be Nsia yi Mbwe, mu sa lili nsomo. <verse eid="GAL 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 4:14" />Ya, si buulu be liimono mpara yi alagha mu nkooro a ebyele ki éli mu nyuru a me, lo be ka lítsaala me o, ya ka líbihi me o. Ya be líibwana a me ti anga ngye-yulu a Nzaami, bwunu we ti anga Yiisu-Kriste. <verse eid="GAL 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 4:15" />Lo esee ki líli a be ekye kunu egyene? Mu kuulu me nsuo bumpughulu bu me mu be ti: Kala áli bukughu okala, be líikaasorolo mihi mi be mu ogwa me mye. <verse eid="GAL 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 4:16" />Lo me bu aandyele be engaŋma, me ayi mutaara a be? <verse eid="GAL 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 4:17" />Mbaa a dzyi yi bali mu okasuo bo mu be ka yili yi mbwe o, bo yini a me badzyi okabala ya be, mpaala be likala a dzyi lili lagha mu bo. <verse eid="GAL 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 4:18" />Oli bubwe mu okala a mbaa yi a dzyi, mu mandagha ma mabwe matala mwohono. Lo ka oli yini a mu matala ma aakankala me emõ ya be o. <verse eid="GAL 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 4:19" />Baana ba me, mpara yi ndi mu okamono me mu be, yili ti anga yi a misuo mimi oburu, me ndi mu omono yo, tee ŋa oosala Kriste mu be. <verse eid="GAL 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 4:20" />Mu matala ma, me ndzyi okala ŋa kara li be, mpaala me nsoolo bu aambili me kundaa be, mu kuulu me ka nsoolo o bunu me aansa mu be.<verse eid="GAL 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Angare ya Saara: efaana ki bindughu byele bi ogwyini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 4:21" />Limalyele ati me, be ba lidzyi okala kunsa litumu li mikyene, be ka liikagyughu mandagha ma básono mu mikyene o? <verse eid="GAL 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 4:22" />Mu kuulu básono ti, Abarahame áburu baana buolo ba babaghala, mumõ mu mukaha wu a nkana, wu muke mu mukaha wu a bumpoholo. <verse eid="GAL 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 4:23" />Lo mwana wu a mu mukaha wu a nkana báburu nde mu gwaa li baara<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.23 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">mu gwaa li baara </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mu mikyene mi bo, kala ti mukaha ka aakaburu o, nde aakatumu mulumu a nde mu oburu mwana ya nkana a nde wu mukaha</char></note>, ya mwana wu a mu mukaha wu a bumpoholo báburu nde mu otswihi misiini mi ógwi Nzaami kundaa Abarahame. <verse eid="GAL 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 4:24" />Ndagha yi yili ti anga nkumu yiili mbaala me yi: Bakaha bansa buolo báli bindughu bibi ogwihini byele. Endughu emõ ki éfi ku munguo wu a Sinayi, ya eekaburu baana ba bankana, kye ngu Angare. <verse eid="GAL 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 4:25" />Mu obo Angare me munguo wu a Sinayi wu li ku Arabi. Ya me nde afaana ya Yerusaleme lili matala ma, mu kuulu lo lili kunsa bunkana ya baana ba lo. <verse eid="GAL 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 4:26" />Lo Yerusaleme lili mayulu lili bumpoholo, ya me lo lili ngughu a bihi. <verse eid="GAL 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 4:27" />Mu kuulu básono ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GAL 4:27">«<char style="qt">Kala mu esee, mukaha wu etini, we wu gwene a baana!</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GAL 4:27">
    <char style="qt">Fulu miluolo mimi esee, we wu áagwene omono mpara a misuo mimi oburu!</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GAL 4:27">
    <char style="qt">Mu kuulu baana ba mukaha wu baanyaghala ku mbala babvulu olagha ya baana ba mukaha wu bakye</char>
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">4.27 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="ISA 54:1">Edz 54.1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>.»<verse eid="GAL 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 4:28" />Lo kundaa be bandughu ba me mu kana, be lili baana baba misiini ti anga Idzake. <verse eid="GAL 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 4:29" />Lo bwunu a bu ókamwehẽ mwana wu báburu mu gwaa li baara<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.29 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Lo bwunu a bu ókamwehẽ mwana wu báburu mu gwaa li baara </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mwana munde me Isimayele</char><char style="ft" closed="false">Otala mu Ebaana 21.9</char></note> mwana munde wu báburu mu Mufulu kimini, oli si nkini bwunu obo mu matala ma. <verse eid="GAL 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GAL 4:30" />Lo Bisono bunu biikalyele? <char style="qt">«Byi mukaha wu a nkana ya mwana a nde wu baghala mu kuulu mwana a nde anyaã okaba mukobo ya mwana a mukaha wu a bumpoholo.»</char> <verse eid="GAL 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GAL 4:31" />Mu obo bandughu ba me mu kana, bihi-a-be ka lili baana baba mu mukaha wu a nkana o, lo baana baba ndaa mukaha wu a bumpoholo.<verse eid="GAL 4:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="GAL 5" />
  <para style="s1">Kriste ágwi bihi bumpoholo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 5:1" />Kriste ákwulu bihi-a-be mpaala likala a nkara bumpoholo. Mu obo, lisa mukama ya ka likihi o ti bafirisa be kunsa ekogholo kii bunkana.<verse eid="GAL 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 5:2" />Ligyughu! Me Poole ndyele kundaa be ti: Kala be likihi osomo nzo a mbaa, lo Kriste ka afirisyili a mupfunu kundaa be o. <verse eid="GAL 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 5:3" />Me firindyele ya me nyeme ti nswe mbwuru wu aasomo nzo a mbaa, nde faana okanama Mikyene myehene. <verse eid="GAL 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 5:4" />Be baliikasagha okala baba nsumu mu Mikyene, be liikaghaba ya Kriste, be liitsili bwehe bu Nzaami. <verse eid="GAL 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 5:5" />Lo mu bihi, mu lileene li Mufulu, bihi lili mu okasa emiini e bihi mu Nzaami, wu aasa kuulu ti bihi-a-be likala bunsumu mu kana li lili a lo. <verse eid="GAL 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 5:6" />Mu kuulu kundaa mbwuru wu li mu Yiisu-Kriste, osomo nzo a mbaa bwunu we ogwene osomo nzo a mbaa ka bili a mupfunu o, lo ki ebvulu mupfunu, kana li liikamoŋono mu dzyi.<verse eid="GAL 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 5:7" />Be líikabara ntyini bubwe. Lo nande aatehebe be, mu okahaba be mu osalala engaŋma? <verse eid="GAL 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 5:8" />Bitsimi bi opeene bibye ka bifi kundaa Nzaami wu aati be mbili o. <verse eid="GAL 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 5:9" />Ya baakalyele ti: «Mana ndaama a pfini yiikasa ti nkpaã a mampa yohono yifuulu!» <verse eid="GAL 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 5:10" />Me, me ndi a emiini mu be mu nkooro a Mfumu. Me nsoolo ti be akala ka litsimi bukimi o. Lo munde wu aalo yaghala ŋa kara li be, sa agyagha masyeme, ngu okala ti nande nde ali. <verse eid="GAL 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 5:11" />Bandughu ba me mu kana, mu me, kala ti me ndi mu ofirikabulutsala nsia yi a osomo nzo a mbaa ti yo yili ndagha yi mupfunu, lo mu emakye bali mu ofirikamwehẽ me kimini? Kala ti obo, bubi bu ookamono baara mu matala ma baakatsala nsia a kuruwa, ka bufirisyili ndagha yi mubwughu o! <verse eid="GAL 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 5:12" />Kala ti obo, nyaã bagwogholo si babo ba bali mu okasa yaghala ŋa kara li be!<verse eid="GAL 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okala mu litumu li Mufulu, lo ka lili nyuru o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 5:13" />Bandughu ba me, báti be mbili mu okala bumpoholo. Oli bubwe ti bumpoholo bubo bunyaã ogwa be nzili yi odzyara mu nyuru! Lo mu dzyi, liikakala basala ba banganda. <verse eid="GAL 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 5:14" />Mu kuulu mikyene myehene bákuru mye mu wu: <char style="qt">«Dzyi nganda-mbwuru ti anga weme.»</char> <verse eid="GAL 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 5:15" />Lo kala ti be beme lili mu okatswa ba bamo myini ya lili mu okakaghala beme-a-beme ti anga banyama, lisa mayele, kala pele be beme sa lidzwa banganda.<verse eid="GAL 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 5:16" />Me bu ndyele be: Liikadzyara mu Mufulu ya be ka lifirigyighili dzyi li nyuru o. <verse eid="GAL 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 5:17" />Mu kuulu nyuru li a dzyi li liikatyeghe Mufulu ebughu, ya Mufulu li a dzyi li liikatyeghe nyuru ebughu. Mufulu ya nyuru ka baakagwihini o, mu kuulu be linyaã osa mandagha ma liikadzyi be osa. <verse eid="GAL 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 5:18" />Lo kala ti be liikadzyara mu Mufulu, be ka lifirikala kunsa litumu li Mikyene o.<verse eid="GAL 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 5:19" />Bigyighili bibi nyuru ngu bi: Esighi, mandagha mama budzwa, enkwunu, <verse eid="GAL 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 5:20" />osamana bityeghe, ndogho, mbele a baara, mumbaŋana, musogho, mankehe, embagha, munkaghaba, etaara, <verse eid="GAL 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 5:21" />osughu mukolo mu bilogho bi banganda, byiri bibi oŋma mala ma malagha ya bibi bilyili, ya mandagha makimi ma mafaana ya mamo mwohono. Me ngyehe be, ti bwunu a bu ántswama ndyele me be ti, ba baakagyighili mandagha mamo ka babagha ebini mu Emfumu e Nzaami o.<verse eid="GAL 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 5:22" />Lo bimburu bibi Mufulu me bi: Dzyi, esee, edzuunu, okuru mukolo mu okebe, bubwe, okabaha babamõ, kana, <verse eid="GAL 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 5:23" />odzuunu, okuru nyuru. Mikyene ka mili etaara ya mandagha mamo o. <verse eid="GAL 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 5:24" />Baara ba bali mu Yiisu-Kriste áyi bákomo manyuru ma bo ŋa kuruwa ya bigyili bi yo bi bibi ya dzyi li yo li libi.<verse eid="GAL 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 5:25" />Kala ti bihi-a-be lili mweẽ mu Mufulu, litswe likadzyara si mu litumu li Mufulu. <verse eid="GAL 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 5:26" />Ka likala a mubili a nyuru o, ka likasa banganda mutaha o, ya ka likasughu mukolo mu banganda o.<verse eid="GAL 5:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="GAL 6" />
  <para style="s1">Osala mu nkooro a bubwe bu banganda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 6:1" />Bandughu ba me mu kana, kala ti basyimi mbwuru mu okasa bubi, be ba lili a Mufulu a Nzaami libvurulu nde mu edzuunu mu nzili yi a nsumu. Lo weme si, sa mayele, mpaala we nyaã obwa mu mwere munde. <verse eid="GAL 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 6:2" />Beme-a-beme, liikabaha babamõ ba bali mu mpara, me obo be liikuhu Mikyene mi Kriste. <verse eid="GAL 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 6:3" />Buulu, nswe munde wu aakatsimi ti nde li mbwuru wu bvulu mupfunu, nde wuulu li mbwuru wu a bwunu, lo nde li mu okapfiri nyuru a ndeme. <verse eid="GAL 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 6:4" />Nswe mbwuru agyighili okehene bigyighili bi nde. Kala ti bye bili bibwe, nyaã nde ndeme amono esee, lo ka mu bigyili bi mbwuru mukimi o. <verse eid="GAL 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 6:5" />Mu kuulu, nswe mbwuru sa abiri leme li nde ndeme.<verse eid="GAL 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 6:6" />Nswe munde wu baaluo Ndagha a Nzaami, agwa kaba lili bilogho bi nde byehene kundaa munde wu li mu okaluo nde. <verse eid="GAL 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 6:7" />Ka ligwuŋumu o, ka baakasebe Nzaami o. Nswe mbwuru aakatolo bimburu bi aakakunu nde. <verse eid="GAL 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 6:8" />Munde wu aakunu mu okuhu gwaa li nyuru a ndeme, sa atolo bi ookaburu nyuru, ngu lipfu. Munde wu aakunu mu Mufulu, sa atolo bi ookaburu Mufulu, me laama lili mibvu ya mibvu. <verse eid="GAL 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 6:9" />Litswe likasa bubwe ku ogwene a okolo, buulu ŋa ookughu matala, kala ti ka likwono o, bihi-a-be litolo bimburu. <verse eid="GAL 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 6:10" />Me mu obo, bu lili a matala, litswe likagyighili mandagha ma mabwe kundaa baara bwohono. Nsomo a nsomo kundaa bandughu mu kana.<verse eid="GAL 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ogyehe kuu masini ya mamboro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 6:11" />Limono bunu-a-bo me aansono be mu kwogho e me bisono bi binene bi! <verse eid="GAL 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 6:12" />Baara bwohono ba badzyi omoŋono ti bali ba babwe mu embwuru, me bo badzyi osohobo be nzo a mbaa mu nko. Bitsimi bi bo bili ti, banyaã omwehẽ bo kimini mu nkooro a lipfu li Kriste ŋa kuruwa. <verse eid="GAL 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 6:13" />Mu kuulu, bomo ba baakasomo nzo a mbaa ka baakasalala Mikyene o, lo bo badzyi ti be lisomo nzo a mbaa, mpaala basa mutwunu mu manyuru ma be.<verse eid="GAL 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 6:14" />Si okala ka bunu, me ngu wuulu ka nkughu okala a mutwunu mu ndagha nkimi o, kala ti ka yini a mu lipfu li Mfumu a bihi-a-be Yiisu-Kriste ŋa kuruwa o. Mu lo, ayi bákomo nsie nsyini ŋa kuruwa mu nkooro a me, ti bwunu a bu bákomo me ŋa kuruwa mu nkooro a bigyighili bi baara ba nsie. <verse eid="GAL 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 6:15" />Mu kuulu, ndagha yi mupfunu ka oli osomo nzo a mbaa o, bwunu we ogwene osomo nzo a mbaa, lo okala mbwuru wu munyaghara. <verse eid="GAL 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 6:16" />Nyaã edzuunu ya nyiĩ bikala ya babo ba akala baanama maluo ma, ya bikala si mu Isarayele li Nzaami.<verse eid="GAL 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 6:17" />Obaana lolo, mbwuru si mumõ anyaã ofirimwehẽ me mpara, mu kuulu me ndi a bigwa ya bikili bi mabogho ma Yiisu mu nyuru a me.<verse eid="GAL 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 6:18" />Bandughu mu kana, nyaã bwehe bu Mfumu a bihi-a-be Yiisu-Kriste bukala ya mufulu a be! Aamene.<verse eid="GAL 6:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 6" />
</usx>